# Session handoff doc — working notes across AI sessions, kept local only.
# Was committed for several commits with real demo-account passwords in
# plaintext, in a public repo (rotated 2026-08-22; see git history if you
# need to purge those old commits too). Never re-add this to tracking.
docs/SESSION_HANDOFF.md

# Local session-recovery transcript dump — a third-party tool's export of
# this project's own Claude Code conversation history. Never committed:
# same reasoning as SESSION_HANDOFF.md above (working notes, not source,
# and a transcript dump is exactly the kind of file that could carry a
# demo credential in plaintext by accident).
recovered/

